## 🛠️ Technical Stack <a id="skills"></a>

{% if has(mermaid_skill_map) and profile.features.mermaid_skill_map %}
<p><b>Skill-to-Project Architecture Graph</b></p>
{{ mermaid_skill_map }}
{% endif %}

{% if has(languages) and profile.features.languages_chart %}
<p><b>Codebase Distribution by Bytes</b></p>
<picture>
  <source media="(prefers-color-scheme: dark)" srcset="assets/languages-dark.svg">
  <source media="(prefers-color-scheme: light)" srcset="assets/languages-light.svg">
  <img alt="{{ languages_alt_text }}" src="assets/languages-dark.svg" width="800">
</picture>
{% endif %}

{% if has(profile.now.learning) %}
🌱 **Currently learning:** {{ profile.now.learning | join(" • ") }}
{% endif %}

{% if has(profile.skills.groups) %}
{% set ns = namespace(has_any_level=false) %}
{% for group in profile.skills.groups %}
  {% for item in group.items %}
    {% if has(item.level) %}{% set ns.has_any_level = true %}{% endif %}
  {% endfor %}
{% endfor %}

{% if ns.has_any_level %}
{% for group in profile.skills.groups %}
{% if has(group.items) %}
### {{ group.name }}

| Technology / Skill | Level |
|:---|:---|
{% for item in group.items %}
| **{{ item.name }}** | {% if has(item.level) %}`{{ item.level.value }}`{% endif %} |
{% endfor %}
{% endif %}
{% endfor %}
{% else %}
<picture>
  <source media="(max-width: 600px) and (prefers-color-scheme: dark)" srcset="assets/tech-stack-mobile-dark.svg">
  <source media="(max-width: 600px) and (prefers-color-scheme: light)" srcset="assets/tech-stack-mobile-light.svg">
  <source media="(max-width: 600px)" srcset="assets/tech-stack-mobile-dark.svg">
  <source media="(prefers-color-scheme: dark)" srcset="assets/tech-stack-dark.svg">
  <source media="(prefers-color-scheme: light)" srcset="assets/tech-stack-light.svg">
  <img alt="Technical Stack — Languages &amp; Core: Python, TypeScript, JavaScript, C++, Java, SQL | Full-Stack Development: React, Next.js, Node.js, FastAPI, Supabase | AI &amp; Machine Learning: PyTorch, TensorFlow, Scikit-learn, OpenCV, Gemini | Cloud, Data &amp; DevOps: Google Cloud Platform, Docker, PostgreSQL, GitHub Actions, Git" src="assets/tech-stack-dark.svg" width="100%">
</picture>

{% endif %}
{% endif %}
